[[Sir Sand]] is an [[accessory]] normally obtained by combining the [[Bag of Stones]] with [[Pocket Sand]]. Its effect reduces the damage both players take for a time at the start of battle, and gives both players {{icon/blind}}. It's nominally a symmetric effect, but it slows the game down, so it tends to favor builds which build-up over time or have ways to cleanse the {{icon/blind}}.
